    "created_at": "2019-03-03T10:36:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-03T10:36:19Z",
    "body": "You can do that yourself, or you can file bugs to MDN to ask them to update via \"Feedback / Report a content problem\" on their interface.\r\n\r\nTraditionally, MDN team updates pages of features when Firefox ships them, and there is a flag on Mozilla's bugzilla for them to track that. I guess maybe other browsers have similar team work together with Mozilla's team nowadays hopefully?",
